WEBVTT

00:01:26.332 --> 00:01:30.211
and a person who follows that diet,

00:01:30.253 --> 00:01:33.131
often used interchangeably
with "plant-based."

00:01:33.131 --> 00:01:38.010
But plant-based
means "vegan" but not vegan.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.887
(Laughter)

00:01:40.429 --> 00:01:44.892
Like, not necessarily done to decrease
animal suffering per se,

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.603
but maybe to help one's health.

00:01:47.645 --> 00:01:52.733
But that is not the argument
we came to have today.

00:01:52.733 --> 00:01:54.110
No siree, Bob.

00:01:54.152 --> 00:01:56.279
(Laughter)

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:59.031
I see some sweet-spot
minds looking to tussle.

00:01:59.073 --> 00:02:00.491
Not at my TED Talk.